@Orders.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5095
@Basket.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:6001

### 0. Primero, agrega un producto al carrito en Basket.API para tener con qué probar
POST {{Basket.API_HostAddress}}/basket
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cart": {
    "userName": "adriana",
    "items": [
      {
        "quantity": 2,
        "color": "N/A",
        "price": 150.50,
        "productId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
        "productName": "Producto de prueba"
      }
    ]
  }
}

### P1: Crear orden válida -> 201 Created
POST {{Orders.API_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: prueba-clave-001

{
  "customerId": "adriana",
  "basketId": "adriana"
}

### P2: Consultar orden -> 200 OK (reemplaza {id} por el que devolvió P1)
GET {{Orders.API_HostAddress}}/api/orders/{id}
Accept: application/json

### Consultar órdenes por cliente
GET {{Orders.API_HostAddress}}/api/orders/customer/adriana
Accept: application/json

### P3: Basket vacío -> 400 Bad Request (usa un customerId sin carrito)
POST {{Orders.API_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "cliente-sin-carrito",
  "basketId": "cliente-sin-carrito"
}

### P4: Repetir la misma Idempotency-Key -> no crea una segunda orden (200 OK, misma orden que P1)
POST {{Orders.API_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: prueba-clave-001

{
  "customerId": "adriana",
  "basketId": "adriana"
}

### P5: Pending -> Confirmed -> 200 OK (reemplaza {id})
PATCH {{Orders.API_HostAddress}}/api/orders/{id}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Confirmed"
}

### P6: Transición inválida (Confirmed -> Cancelled ya no aplica desde Confirmed) -> 409 Conflict
PATCH {{Orders.API_HostAddress}}/api/orders/{id}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Cancelled"
}

### Documentación interactiva (Swagger)
GET {{Orders.API_HostAddress}}/swagger/index.html

### Health check
GET {{Orders.API_HostAddress}}/health
